{"id": "EUVD-2026-108647", "enisaUuid": "12b3a273-722c-34df-bedf-76e855994a76", "description": "`JwtClaims.MarshalJSON` built a Go struct at runtime with `reflect.StructOf`, synthesising a field named `\"A\" + claimName` for each untyped claim. `reflect.StructOf` **panics** when a field name is not a valid Go identifier, or when it duplicates another field. Both conditions are reachable from ordinary JWT claim names.", "datePublished": "2026-10-23T08:46:30", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T08:46:30", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/eclipse-keypont/gose/security/advisories/GHSA-hwm6-rwv6-xgq8"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89315"], "assigner": "eclipse", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1f2bb857-5f38-3faf-989c-818d7869cd71", "product": {"name": "Eclipse KeyPont - GOSE", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0.7.3 \u22640.13.0-rc1"}, {"id": "f8c3e3ce-41fd-3b48-9446-43088d15944e", "product": {"name": "Eclipse KeyPont - GOSE", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.0.0-rc4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f040c584-2f35-3efe-8fe3-ca035a9d16a8", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}